E
key~
Vex highly reccomends using color to view the map. Type "color complete" to
see if your terminal supports color.
X is the Map Room - Where you are now.
Guilds - You can practice your skills at your guild.
------
Thi = Thieves Guild                Mag = Mages Guild
As  = Assassins Guild              Ne  = Necromancers Guild
Sd  = Shadow Dancers Guild         Cn  = Conjurers Guild
Cle = Clerics Guild                War = Warriors Guild
Dk  = Death Knights Guild          Sl  = Shao-lins Guild
Kn  = Solamnic Knights Guild       Ra  = Rangers Guild
Shops - The Water Works and Bakery sell water containers and food.
-----
medit save  = Magic Shop         BA  = Bakery         Water Works = Water Works :)
AP  = Apothecary         WV  = Weaver         MS = Map Shop
medit  = Metaphysican       GR  = Grocer         BF = Bowyer/Fletcher
HS  = Healers Shop       GI  = Grubby Inn     AS = Armor Shop
CE  = Casting Emporium   BH  = Boat House     WS = Weapon Shop
JW  = Jeweler            CJ  = Captain Jack's KP = Kender's Pouch
LS  = Leather Shop       Lock = Locksmith
Places of Importance - The salvation army depot is a good place to start.
--------------------
Depot = Salvation Army Depot      AG = Adventurers Guild
BK    = Bank                      PO = Post Office
INN = Laughing Wench Inn -> You can save your items here for up to 30 days.
BH  = Mother Risen's Boarding House -> Items can be saved for 120 days here.
Ctr = The Center of Samsera -> Samsera recall scrolls take you here.
For more of the symbols (and a few tips on where to start), type "look more"
~
E
more~
Samsera Map Key continued.

Places of Interest
------------------
AR  = The Samsera Arena - You can battle other adventurers with out loss.
CLA = Hall of Clans               CH   = Church of All Gods
JU  = Hall of Justice             MH   = Mayor's House
Tow = Tower of the Winds          Sab  = Sabrina's House of Servitude
WG  = West Gate of Samsera        EG   = East Gate of Samsera
NG  = North Gate of Samsera       Pier = Pier, leads to the River.
HQ  = City Guard Head Quarters    TH   = Towne Hall
HB  = Halls of Blood
~
